Package: rapsimng.canola
Title: Crop-Specific Functions and Parameters for APSIM Next Generation Canola Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bangyou", "Zheng", email = "zheng.bangyou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides canola-specific functions, processes and parameter sets used by
    canola model in the Agricultural Production Systems sIMulator ('APSIM') Next Generation.
    Includes tools for crop process calculations, parameter management and customisation, 
    enabling users to explore, modify and apply canola model components.
